  },
  "aggregation": {
    "individualUpTo": 4,
    "provisional": "PROVISIONAL view default - D-038 H8 (how many parts a settlement shows before it becomes unreadable, and what happens past that) is UNRULED. The individually drawn reports are the first N by (established, key): an arbitrary, documented order, not a judgement of significance."
